changed_lines:
-3.1.9 Entering a class or breaking into school function without the permission of those concerned;
-3.1.10 Staying in campus beyond the authorized time;
-3.1.11 Unauthorized distribution or posting within school premises of leaflets, handbills or other printed materials whose authorship is not clearly stated therein;
-3.1.12 Texting and use of cellular phones for non-instructional purposes during classes or lectures;
-3.1.13 Attending seminars/webinars, lectures, and teach-ins or any similar cases bringing the name of the University, without due notice to their respective deans/advisers, without approval by the VPSD, VPAS and the President of the university;
-3.1.14 Sharing of unauthorized announcement;
-3.1.15 Taking out/Posting of announcements without permit;
-3.1.16 Improper use of toilet and other university facilities; and
-3.1.17 Such other acts as may herein be determined from time to time by the Disciplinary Committee
